---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import config from '../../data/config.json';
import settings from '../../data/site-settings.json';
import councillors from '../../data/councillors.json';

const clerkPerson = councillors.people.find(p => p.role === 'clerk' && p.active);
---
<Layout title_cy="Datganiad Hygyrchedd" title_en="Accessibility Statement">
  <div class="page-banner">
    <h1><span lang="cy">Datganiad Hygyrchedd</span><span lang="en">Accessibility Statement</span></h1>
  </div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Hygyrchedd</span><span lang="en">Accessibility</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content">

    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Datganiad Hygyrchedd</span><span lang="en">Accessibility Statement</span></h2>
    <hr class="sh-rule">

    <div class="notice">
      <span lang="cy">Mae'r datganiad hwn yn berthnasol i wefan <strong>{config.site.url}</strong></span>
      <span lang="en">This statement applies to the website <strong>{config.site.url}</strong></span>
    </div>

    <!-- ENGLISH VERSION -->
    <div lang="en">
      <p>This website is run by {config.site.name_en}. We want as many people as possible to be able to use this website. For example, that means you should be able to:</p>
      <ul style="margin:0.5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem;line-height:2">
        <li>Change colours, contrast levels and fonts using browser or device settings</li>
        <li>Zoom in up to 400% without the text spilling off the screen</li>
        <li>Navigate most of the website using a keyboard or speech recognition software</li>
        <li>Listen to most of the website using a screen reader</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">How accessible this website is</h3>
      <p>We know some parts of this website are not fully accessible. We are working towards full compliance with the <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) version 2.2 AA standard</a>.</p>
      <p>Current status: <span class="a11y-status partial">Partially conformant</span></p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Known accessibility issues</h3>
      <ul style="margin:0.5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem;line-height:2">
        <li>Some PDF documents may not be fully accessible — we are working to provide accessible versions</li>
        <li>Some older documents may not have Welsh language versions</li>
        <li>The interactive ward map may not be fully usable with a keyboard or screen reader. Contact the Clerk if you need a description of the ward boundaries.</li>
        <li>Some text and colour combinations may not meet the minimum contrast ratio. We are reviewing these.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>PDFs and other documents published before 23 September 2018 are not covered by the accessibility regulations unless they are needed for our services. If you cannot use one, contact the Clerk and we will provide it in another format.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Feedback and contact information</h3>
      <p>If you need information on this website in a different format, such as accessible PDF, large print, easy read, audio recording or braille, contact:</p>
      <p><strong>{clerkPerson?.name}</strong>, {config.site.name_en}<br>
      Email: <a href={`mailto:${settings.council.email}`}>{settings.council.email}</a></p>
      <p>We will consider your request and get back to you within 5 working days.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Reporting accessibility problems</h3>
      <p>We are always looking to improve the accessibility of this website. If you find any problems not listed on this page or think we are not meeting accessibility requirements, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${settings.council.email}`}>{settings.council.email}</a>.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Enforcement procedure</h3>
      <p>The Equality and Human Rights Commission (EHRC) is responsible for enforcing the Public Sector Bodies (Websites and Mobile Applications) (No. 2) Accessibility Regulations 2018 (the 'accessibility regulations'). If you're not happy with how we respond to your complaint, <a href="https://www.equalityadvisoryservice.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">contact the Equality Advisory and Support Service (EASS)</a>.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Technical information</h3>
      <p>{config.site.name_en} is committed to making its website accessible, in accordance with the Public Sector Bodies (Websites and Mobile Applications) (No. 2) Accessibility Regulations 2018.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Compliance status</h3>
      <p>This website is partially conformant with the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines version 2.2 AA standard, due to the non-compliances listed above.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Preparation of this accessibility statement</h3>
      <p>This statement was prepared in September 2026 and last reviewed in October 2026. The website has been checked using automated testing tools (Google Lighthouse and WAVE). A full manual audit against WCAG 2.2 AA has not yet been carried out; we will update this statement when it has.</p>
    </div>

    <hr style="margin:2rem 0;border-color:var(--border)">

    <!-- WELSH VERSION -->
    <div lang="cy">
      <p>Mae'r wefan hon yn cael ei rhedeg gan {config.site.name_cy}. Rydym eisiau i gymaint o bobl â phosib allu defnyddio'r wefan hon. Er enghraifft, dylech allu:</p>
      <ul style="margin:0.5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem;line-height:2">
        <li>Newid lliwiau, lefelau cyferbyniad a ffontiau gan ddefnyddio gosodiadau'r porwr neu'r ddyfais</li>
        <li>Chwyddo hyd at 400% heb i'r testun fynd oddi ar y sgrin</li>
        <li>Llywio'r rhan fwyaf o'r wefan gan ddefnyddio bysellfwrdd neu feddalwedd adnabod llais</li>
        <li>Gwrando ar y rhan fwyaf o'r wefan gan ddefnyddio darllenydd sgrin</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Faint o hygyrchedd sydd ar y wefan hon</h3>
      <p>Mae {config.site.name_cy} yn ymrwymedig i wneud ei wefan yn hygyrch yn unol â Rheoliadau Hygyrchedd Cyrff y Sector Cyhoeddus (Gwefannau a Chymwysiadau Symudol) (Rhif 2) 2018.</p>
      <p>Mae'r wefan hon yn <span class="a11y-status partial">cydymffurfio'n rhannol</span> â safon WCAG 2.2 AA.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Problemau hygyrchedd hysbys</h3>
      <ul style="margin:0.5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem;line-height:2">
        <li>Efallai nad yw rhai dogfennau PDF yn gwbl hygyrch — rydym yn gweithio i ddarparu fersiynau hygyrch</li>
        <li>Efallai nad oes fersiynau Cymraeg o rai dogfennau hŷn</li>
        <li>Efallai nad yw map rhyngweithiol y wardiau yn gwbl ddefnyddiadwy gyda bysellfwrdd neu ddarllenydd sgrin. Cysylltwch â'r Clerc os oes angen disgrifiad o ffiniau'r wardiau arnoch.</li>
        <li>Efallai nad yw rhai cyfuniadau o destun a lliw yn bodloni'r gymhareb cyferbyniad isaf. Rydym yn adolygu'r rhain.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Nid yw'r rheoliadau hygyrchedd yn cwmpasu PDFs a dogfennau eraill a gyhoeddwyd cyn 23 Medi 2018 oni bai bod eu hangen ar gyfer ein gwasanaethau. Os na allwch ddefnyddio un, cysylltwch â'r Clerc a byddwn yn ei darparu mewn fformat arall.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Adborth a gwybodaeth gyswllt</h3>
      <p>Os oes angen y wybodaeth ar y wefan hon arnoch mewn fformat gwahanol, megis PDF hygyrch, print bras, hawdd ei ddarllen, recordiad sain neu braille, cysylltwch â:</p>
      <p><strong>{clerkPerson?.name}</strong>, {config.site.name_cy}<br>
      E-bost: <a href={`mailto:${settings.council.email}`}>{settings.council.email}</a></p>
      <p>Byddwn yn ystyried eich cais ac yn ymateb o fewn 5 diwrnod gwaith.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Adrodd am broblemau hygyrchedd</h3>
      <p>Rydym bob amser yn ceisio gwella hygyrchedd y wefan hon. Os byddwch yn dod o hyd i unrhyw broblemau nad ydynt wedi'u rhestru ar y dudalen hon, neu os ydych yn meddwl nad ydym yn bodloni gofynion hygyrchedd, cysylltwch â ni yn <a href={`mailto:${settings.council.email}`}>{settings.council.email}</a>.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Gweithdrefn gorfodi</h3>
      <p>Y Comisiwn Cydraddoldeb a Hawliau Dynol (EHRC) sy'n gyfrifol am orfodi'r rheoliadau hygyrchedd. Os nad ydych yn hapus â sut rydym yn ymateb i'ch cwyn, <a href="https://www.equalityadvisoryservice.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cysylltwch â'r Gwasanaeth Cynghori a Chefnogi Cydraddoldeb (EASS)</a>.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-sh">Paratoi'r datganiad hygyrchedd hwn</h3>
      <p>Paratowyd y datganiad hwn ym mis Medi 2026 a'i adolygu ddiwethaf ym mis Hydref 2026. Mae'r wefan wedi'i gwirio gan ddefnyddio offer profi awtomatig (Google Lighthouse a WAVE). Nid yw archwiliad llawn â llaw yn erbyn WCAG 2.2 AA wedi'i gynnal eto; byddwn yn diweddaru'r datganiad hwn pan fydd wedi'i gynnal.</p>
    </div>

  </div></div>
</Layout>
